 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** A 3D position $X \in \mathbb{R}^3$ and a scalar elastic ratio $e \in [0, 1]$.
-*   **Output:** Displacement vectors for position ($T_X$), scaling ($T_s$), and rotation ($T_q$).
